WEBVTT

00:46.040 --> 00:47.040
General

00:47.120 --> 00:49.120
Prince of Jin has been captured

00:51.240 --> 00:52.640
Good

00:53.720 --> 00:56.053
You've given me quite a few surprises

00:57.000 --> 00:57.920
General

00:58.000 --> 00:59.280
This time capturing Prince of Jin alive

00:59.360 --> 01:01.040
As long as we bring him to the western front

01:01.120 --> 01:01.760
Great Chanyu Ayidai

01:01.840 --> 01:03.080
Will certainly

01:03.160 --> 01:04.440
Stop nagging

01:04.520 --> 01:06.853
I don't need you to teach me

01:11.640 --> 01:13.307
I don't humiliate brave men

01:13.440 --> 01:14.280
Later

01:14.360 --> 01:15.560
Burn his body

01:15.640 --> 01:16.240
With this house

01:16.320 --> 01:17.720
Together

